You are tasked with implementing a Vector class in Python that supports basic vector operations. The class should be able to perform addition, subtraction, scalar multiplication, and dot product operations on vectors of the same dimension. Additionally, the class should raise a custom exception when attempting to operate on vectors of different dimensions.

